{"text": "INVOICE / FACTUUR\nVan der Meulen Scheepstechniek B.V.\n\nHavenkade 41-43, 3011 XK Rotterdam, The Netherlands\n\nKvK 24477180 · BTW/VAT NL004471882B01 · T +31 10 555 0147 ·\nadministratie@vdmscheepstechniek.example\n\nInvoice no.: 2026-0418\n\nInvoice date: 12-05-2026\n\nDue date: 11-06-2026\n\nYour PO: CCF/PO/7741\n\nOur project: P-2611\n\nBill to\nCladdagh Coastal Ferries DAC\n\nAttn. Siobhán Ní Bhraonáin, Technical Superintendent\n\nUnit 6, Docks Enterprise Park, Galway, H91 X4T2, Ireland\n\nVAT no. IE3344718TH\n\nDescription\nDry-dock overhaul of the port-side main engine gearbox and replacement of the\nstern tube seals on the passenger ferry \"Aisling na Mara\", IMO 9044718, carried\nout at our yard between 20 April and 7 May 2026.\n\nItem Qty Amount (EUR)\nLabour, fitters 212 h € 18.020,00\nGearbox bearings 1 set € 9.460,00\nStern tube seals 2 € 4.250,00\nDock hire, 9 days 9 € 6.750,00\nClass surveyor 1 € 1.180,50\nTotal excl. VAT € 39.660,50\nVAT 0% € 0,00\nTotal due € 39.660,50\n\nVAT reverse-charged to the customer under Article 44 of VAT Directive\n2006/112/EC. An advance of EUR 15,000 was received on 17 April 2026 against pro-\nforma PF-2026-0092 and is NOT deducted above; balance now payable is €\n24.660,50.\n\nPayment\nPlease pay within 30 days to Noordzee Handelsbank N.V., Rotterdam.\n\nIBAN: NL48 RABO 0447 1882 03\n\nBIC: NZHBNL2R\n\nQuote the invoice number. Late payment interest runs at the statutory\ncommercial rate.\n\nNotes\nThe seal housings showed scoring consistent with the grounding off Inis Oírr in\nFebruary that Ms. Ní Bhraonáin mentioned; we recommend a shaft alignment\ncheck at the next docking. Warranty on parts is twelve months. Our work is\ncertified to ISO 9001; delivery terms per Incoterms do not apply to services.\n\nQuestions about this invoice: Anouk de Vries-Bakker, accounts receivable, direct\n010-555 01 62, a.devries@vdmscheepstechniek.example.\n\nSigned for the company: J. van der Meulen, director", "kind": "PDF", "d